{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eco-Sentinel : The Bottle Mission&quot; is an action-survival game set in a bustling urban environment where you play as a young scavenger trying to survive by collecting recyclable bottles scattered across the city. Earn money by depositing the bottles at recycling stations \u2014 but watch out! The streets are patrolled by the police who see your scavenging as suspicious behavior. Stay out of their sight, avoid getting caught, and use your earnings to buy essentials and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through alleyways, outrun the authorities, and make smart choices to thrive in a world that\u2019s as challenging as it is rewarding. The more you recycle, the more you earn \u2014 but the risk gets higher too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you collect enough before time runs out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575750?t=1756278586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575750/dc32093ba94dd0f2c1da2843d8ab4b8337046a23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756278586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575750/295551e0eaadda57923d0c362929cc084bf0f5a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756278586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575750/295551e0eaadda57923d0c362929cc084bf0f5a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756278586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eco-Sentinel : The Bottle Mission&quot; is an action-survival game set in a bustling urban e